<</Producer(Antenna House PDF Output Library 6.5.1119 \(Windows \(x64\)\); modified using iText 2.1.7 by 1T3XT)/Keywords(STM32CubeH7, STM32 MCU Package)/Trapped/False/ModDate(D:20200705232517+02'00')/Subject(The STM32CubeH7 MCU Package is composed of the STM32Cube’ hardware abstraction layer \(HAL\), plus a consistent set of middleware components \(such as RTOS, USB, TCP/IP and graphics\). All embedded software utilities are delivered with a full set of examples running on STMicroelectronics boards.)/Creator(C2 v4.2.0220 build 670 - c2_rendition_config : Techlit_Active)/Title( Description of STM32H7 HAL and low-layer drivers - User manual)/Revision(5)/Document_Title( Description of STM32H7 HAL and low-layer drivers)/Alternate_Name(UM2217)/Classification(Public)/Document_Type(User manual)/CreationDate(D:20200702130329+01'00')/Author(STMICROELECTRONICS)>>
